          "quote": "Previous song playlists better now update very bad....",
          "review_id": "a526a9b8-a2ac-412a-96ce-3d9f40163ba4"
        },
        {
          "quote": "The app is great and all but whenever I put on my Playlist of songs I CHOSE TO LISTEN TO , it plays recommended songs instead.",
          "review_id": "3dae0f02-27f2-4c76-85e9-80e1758f6ee6"
        },
        {
          "quote": "Why does it add songs to my playlist if I don't want them and why can't I just play any song any time. Also too many adds",
          "review_id": "d157c425-9510-4243-a935-e8c7899f172c"
        }
      ],
      "issue_id": "usability.queue_playlist_management",
      "name": "Playlists and queue play unwanted songs"
    },
